+/**
+ * A variable controlling whether the Direct3D 11 renderer presents with a
+ * blit-model swap chain (DXGI_SWAP_EFFECT_DISCARD) instead of a flip-model one.
+ *
+ * Flip-model presents aren't synchronized with the window's size, so during a
+ * live resize the content can trail the window's edges, notably on integrated
+ * GPUs. A blit-model present lands with the new size. Transparent windows
+ * always use the blit model.
+ *
+ * The variable can be set to the following values:
+ *
+ * - "0": Use the flip model. (default)
+ * - "1": Use the blit model.
+ *
+ * This hint should be set before creating a renderer.
+ */
+#define SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_BLIT_MODEL "SDL_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_BLIT_MODEL"
+
 /**
  * A variable controlling whether to enable Vulkan Validation Layers.
  *
